{
  "_comment": "GOLDEN FIXTURE (blind spots): each Orphan measure is used only inside the model itself. Orphan Format: a measure's formatStringDefinition. Orphan KPI: a KPI target expression. Orphan Detail: detailRowsDefinition. Orphan Calc Table: a calculated table. Margin [%]: named with the ]] escape. Truly Unused is the true-positive control.",
